This game plugin contains material by gamerpuppy, derived from sts_lightspeed
(https://github.com/gamerpuppy/sts_lightspeed), commit 7476a81954020087da31d41d16fddf475746ec2d
(2024-08-10), licensed under the MIT License, Copyright (c) 2021 gamerpuppy. The original
license text is in lightspeed/LICENSE.

Derived material (paths from games/slay-the-spire/):
  lightspeed/aas-hooks.patch      changes to sts_lightspeed sources, carrying their surrounding code
  lightspeed/event-fixes.patch    changes to sts_lightspeed sources, carrying their surrounding code
  lightspeed/aas.cpp              a planner built against the sts_lightspeed sources and library
  expert-weights.json             card ratings generated from src/sim/search/ExpertKnowledge.cpp
  event-names.json                event names and ids from include/constants/Events.h
  bot.mjs                         its card-reward rule follows src/sim/search/ExpertKnowledge.cpp

sts_lightspeed itself is not vendored: lightspeed/build.sh clones it into .local/sts_lightspeed.

